## Test Plan
- [ ] Test with statusFilter: `["UNCHANGED"]` - returns only unchanged nodes
- [ ] Test with statusFilter: `["NEW", "MOD", "DEL", "UNCHANGED"]` - returns all nodes
- [ ] Test with empty statusFilter - returns only NEW, MOD, DEL (backward compatible)
- [ ] Verify no recursion occurs for UNCHANGED nodes (performance optimization)

